{
  "declaredLength": 7160,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Comment elle fait pour être aussi forte avec\nune personnalité pareille ? Je pige pas...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Même si les types sont en ma défaveur, y a pas de\nraison qu’elle m’écrase comme ça à chaque fois...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et puis pourquoi elle fait partie de l’élite ?!\nElle fait que tricher avec sa Zone Violine...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma chère Delphie...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100200063006800E800720065002000440065006C0070006800690065002E002E002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Que reprochez-vous à ma personnalité ?\nEt à quelle tricherie faites-vous donc référence ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein ? Euh... Quoi ? Oh, euh, vous avez\ncertainement mal entendu...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650069006E0020003F0020004500750068002E002E002E002000510075006F00690020003F0020004F0068002C0020006500750068002C00200076006F007500730020006100760065007A000A006300650072007400610069006E0065006D0065006E00740020006D0061006C00200065006E00740065006E00640075002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’Holokit semble mal fonctionner ici...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C20190048006F006C006F006B00690074002000730065006D0062006C00650020006D0061006C00200066006F006E006300740069006F006E006E006500720020006900630069002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je m’émerveillais simplement de la force\net de la personnalité de vos Pokémon...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEt je disais que la Zone Violine était\nune « riche » idée !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... Je vois. La réception de l’Holokit semble\neffectivement très mauvaise.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est étrange, car sans lui, je vous ai bien entendu\ncritiquer ma personnalité et m’accuser de tricher.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je... je... j’étais sous pression et mes mots ont\ndépassé ma pensée, voilà tout !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce n’est qu’un simple malentendu !\nFaisons un combat pour le dissiper !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous avez raison. Un combat s’impose pour\nclarifier tout cela. ♥<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006100760065007A00200072006100690073006F006E002E00200055006E00200063006F006D0062006100740020007320190069006D0070006F0073006500200070006F00750072000A0063006C006100720069006600690065007200200074006F00750074002000630065006C0061002E0020266500100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma chère Delphie. Pour ce combat, je vais faire\néquipe avec <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ici présent<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu es d’accord, bien entendu ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540075002000650073002000642019006100630063006F00720064002C0020006200690065006E00200065006E00740065006E006400750020003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien entendu !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E00200065006E00740065006E00640075002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas tout de suite !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200074006F00750074002000640065002000730075006900740065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu as l’occasion de combattre à la fois\nà mes côtés ET contre moi !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nComment refuser une opportunité pareille ? ♥<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 120
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Seule l’élite de la société peut se vanter d’être à\nla fois alliée et adversaire dans le même combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Accepte de te battre contre cette version\nholographique de moi-même, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si on se bat, peut-être que Dame Violine oubliera\ntout ce que j’ai dit sur elle !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En garde !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000670061007200640065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un instant...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200069006E007300740061006E0074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ne nous faites pas trop patienter !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00650020006E006F0075007300200066006100690074006500730020007000610073002000740072006F0070002000700061007400690065006E0074006500720020002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avec ma fidèle Delphie à mes côtés,\nc’est comme si nous avions déjà gagné !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vas-y, bats-toi ! Si tu le fais pas pour toi,\nfais-le au moins pour moi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si je concentre mes attaques sur Dame Violine,\nelle oubliera peut-être tout ce que j’ai dit !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis prête à affronter le monde entier\navec toi ! ♥<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007300750069007300200070007200EA00740065002000E000200061006600660072006F006E0074006500720020006C00650020006D006F006E0064006500200065006E0074006900650072000A006100760065006300200074006F0069002000210020266500100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je guiderai Illumis vers le bonheur !\nMélodelfe, à toi de jouer ! ♥<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200067007500690064006500720061006900200049006C006C0075006D00690073002000760065007200730020006C006500200062006F006E006800650075007200200021000A004D00E9006C006F00640065006C00660065002C002000E000200074006F00690020006400650020006A006F007500650072002000210020266500100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai gardé l’meilleur pour la fin !\nKravarech, méga-évolue et déchaîne-toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Que c’est étrange ! Je ne suis qu’un hologramme\net pourtant, je peux utiliser la Méga-Évolution !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La victoire est mienne !\nQui en avait douté ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200076006900630074006F00690072006500200065007300740020006D00690065006E006E006500200021000A00510075006900200065006E00200061007600610069007400200064006F0075007400E90020003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’ai jamais vu Delphie se plaindre de moi\ncomme elle l’a fait tout à l’heure...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nSerait-elle insatisfaite de sa condition ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je peine à comprendre comment elle peut\nne pas s’estimer heureuse d’être à mes côtés.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne parviens pas à vous battre.\nC’est de là que vient ma frustration...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et je l’ai exprimée de manière... maladroite.\nMais je vais m’appliquer davantage !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fort bien ! Nous allons donc augmenter\nla cadence de ton entraînement !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dorénavant, tu te battras à la fois contre moi\net contre cet hologramme !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tiens, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, je t’offre ceci en guise\nde remerciement pour ta participation.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous obtenez une robe de Violine d’une autre\ncouleur !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006F006200740065006E0065007A00200075006E006500200072006F00620065002000640065002000560069006F006C0069006E00650020006420190075006E0065002000610075007400720065000A0063006F0075006C006500750072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je te recommande aussi d’adopter ma fabuleuse\ncoupe de cheveux pour compléter ton look !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avoir affronté mon hologramme m’a permis de\nprendre la mesure de mes immenses qualités.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Même holographique, je reste moi.\nJe suis la seule ! L’unique !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00EA006D006500200068006F006C006F006700720061007000680069007100750065002C0020006A00650020007200650073007400650020006D006F0069002E000A004A0065002000730075006900730020006C00610020007300650075006C0065002000210020004C20190075006E00690071007500650020002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il va falloir que j’apprenne à mieux contenir\nma frustration, sinon ça va barder pour moi...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    }
  ],
